# {{ project_name }}

{{ description }}

An LV2 plugin for the Darkglass Anagram, written with [crabgram](https://github.com/kimhappy/crabgram).

## Commands

```sh
nix develop            # native shell
nix develop .#anagram  # device shell

cargo {{ project_slug }} bundle  # assemble the bundle; native: the standalone app in build/{{ project_slug }}/
cargo {{ project_slug }} check   # check the bundle
cargo {{ project_slug }} deploy  # device shell: install over SSH; --host <ssh destination> for another host
cargo test                       # unit tests on the real LV2 entry points
cargo miri test -p {{ project_slug }}
```

Or without entering a shell: `nix develop --command cargo {{ project_slug }} bundle`.

Nix reads the project through git, so `flake.nix` and `flake.lock` must be tracked: run `git add -N flake.nix` before the first `nix develop` and `git add flake.lock` after it.

Cargo and `flake.nix` both take crabgram from GitHub: Cargo the crates, pinned in `Cargo.lock`, and Nix the shells, pinned in `flake.lock`. To move to a newer crabgram, run `cargo update -p crabgram` and `nix flake update crabgram`.
